1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,806
How did such a mighty elephant get saved by just one lotus flower?

2
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:05,994
Gajendra was the king of the elephants.

3
00:00:06,074 --> 00:00:09,543
One day, he went with his family to drink water at a lake.

4
00:00:09,853 --> 00:00:13,581
Suddenly, from under the water, a crocodile grabbed his leg.

5
00:00:14,087 --> 00:00:17,342
Gajendra pulled with all his strength, and his family pulled him too.

6
00:00:17,423 --> 00:00:20,203
But the crocodile kept dragging him into deeper water.

7
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:21,716
A very long time passed.

8
00:00:21,896 --> 00:00:25,454
His family gave up, and Gajendra's strength began to run out.

9
00:00:25,753 --> 00:00:27,747
Then he remembered Lord Vishnu.

10
00:00:27,927 --> 00:00:32,040
With his trunk he plucked a lotus, raised it high and called out, O Narayan!

11
00:00:32,753 --> 00:00:36,712
The moment Lord Vishnu heard the call, he rushed there riding on Garuda.

12
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:41,144
He released the Sudarshan Chakra and freed Gajendra from the crocodile.

13
00:00:41,424 --> 00:00:44,216
It was not his strength that saved him, but a call from a true heart.

14
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:45,813
Lesson.

15
00:00:46,093 --> 00:00:49,534
When our own strength is not enough, still don't lose courage.

16
00:00:49,814 --> 00:00:52,891
Remember God with a true heart, help surely comes.

17
00:00:53,487 --> 00:00:58,126
If you want to watch stories like this every day and learn something new,

18
00:00:58,206 --> 00:01:02,069
then Like the video, Share it, and do Subscribe to the channel.

19
00:01:02,149 --> 00:01:03,767
See you in the next story!
